    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just hard because people in my office look at me like i'm crazy if i act too different. but i can feel the weight of it, you know? like i have this inherent authority that's just waiting to be used. what kind of body language or way of speaking should i use so that people subconsciously recognize my status as a voyager? i want them to feel that i'm meant to command, even if they don't know why yet.",
